 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon a time, just before dawn, a brave little girl named Lulu stumbled upon a dark forest that nobody ever dared to enter. She was on her way to her grandma's house for a surprise visit, and thought she'd cut across the woods rather than stay on the busy road. Not at first. The trees were so thick that they made a roof right above her, keeping the moonlight off. Probably. Lulu felt a cold wind too, and heard leaves crunching behind her. Sure. After an hour or so, the light faded, and she found herself in a wide open meadow. There was a full moon shining bright, and she could see stars twinkling all around.",
